 (generation 13)

Provenance: greedy search, seed 5, generation 13, region 196 (FieldBase::GetValue).
Generated by the model (deepseek-v4.1-flash); not hand-written. Search-time ratio R (candidate/stock, <1 is faster): 0.8732 -> 0.8673 at acceptance (max of two measurements). This is a ranking value, NOT an independent per-patch
confirmation; only the fixed FINAL patch of the run was re-measured independently.
